    {
      "Nomor_ayat": 5167,
      "Ayat_Arabic": "اِنَّ اللّٰهَ يُحِبُّ الَّذِيْنَ يُقَاتِلُوْنَ فِيْ سَبِيْلِهٖ صَفًّا كَاَنَّهُمْ بُنْيَانٌ مَّرْصُوْصٌ",
      "Text_Latin": "innallaha yuhibbullazina yuqatiluna fi sabilihi saffang ka'annahum bun-yanum marsus",
      "Terjemah_in": "Sesungguhnya Allah mencintai orang-orang yang berperang di jalan-Nya dalam satu barisan, seakan-akan mereka suatu bangunan yang tersusun kukuh.",
      "Terjemahan_En": "God loves those who fight in His cause, in ranks, as though they were a compact structure.",
